# Code owners for pixeloven/design.
#
# The studio — PixelOven's art pipeline — is code owner for the sections it
# authors: the 3D standard and its art direction (DDR-0012,
# decisions/0012-studio-code-ownership.md). It lands changes there on its own
# PR path, with an independent reviewer. A change that loosens a check needs a
# second reviewer and is shown to the operator for approval; CODEOWNERS cannot
# express that rule, so process.md states it.
#
# Every other path keeps the repository's normal owners, so there is no
# catch-all `*` rule here.
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PLACEHOLDER — the studio's GitHub identity (a user or a pixeloven/<team>)
# is not yet known. The rules below stay commented out until it is, because
# an owner that does not resolve is reported as an error and owns nothing.
# Replace STUDIO_GITHUB_OWNER and uncomment.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The 3D standard.
# /catalog/scene/                          STUDIO_GITHUB_OWNER
#
# Studio-authored art direction under catalog/art/. CODEOWNERS is path-based,
# so add one line per studio-authored entry as it lands, and list `studio` in
# that entry's `owners` frontmatter. Entries the design repo authors under
# catalog/art/ are not listed here.
# /catalog/art/<slug>.md                   STUDIO_GITHUB_OWNER
# /catalog/art/<slug>/                     STUDIO_GITHUB_OWNER
